{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "769c71b2217ec172c9b9e287c89e6068614d0c2c8eff960b4e472178d2cc9cc6", "ja": "（杏奈の曲『Happy Darling』のPV撮影だ。\n恋する女の子と、恋を応援する2役を演じた……）", "zh": "（正在拍摄以杏奈的歌曲《Happy Darling》为主题的PV。饰演了恋爱中的女孩，以及为恋情加油的2……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "0d39c7e47a87ee3ad34b26fa04f50a02ebb18761059d995aa3db8c095426a3f1", "ja": "{$P$}さん……どうだった……？\n杏奈、ちゃんと演技……できてた……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……怎么样……？\n杏奈，演技……演得还好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1002_p", "source_sha256": "16baaaa1f651102678d08b5a7571600a17c86ed1282b6dde01a278ce26b48e6e", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ。\n監督さんも喜んでたし、言うこと無しだ。", "zh": "啊，表现得非常好。\n导演也很满意，没什么可挑剔的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "b61fd2edceb600c39a773da7c25e3e0413b6e5f608466aafdb0494c273201632", "ja": "ほんと……？　杏奈……メイクとか、オシャレとか……\nあんまり、やったことないから……心配で……。", "zh": "真的……？杏奈……化妆啊、打扮啊……\n因为都没怎么做过……所以有点担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "17a34940f23fee353cf52e80e281548a34bd8005928082fc1ccf4419c799651d", "ja": "あっ。んと……お仕事だと……メイクも、服も……\nプロの人が、やってくれる……でしょ……？", "zh": "啊。那个……工作的时候……化妆和衣服……\n都是专业人士……来负责的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "899f0c1d4ea43fad5cd42f604ecca4537415316b9a7f4350e1f8f59e180b9505", "ja": "でも、自分じゃ……あんまり……。台本のとおりに……\nやってみた、けど……難しかった……です……。", "zh": "但是，自己来做的话……不太……。虽然试着按照剧本……做了……但还是很难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1006_p", "source_sha256": "57f4b3b1b55486e8bd82d0a2c9ad3b134b46ccc8883e74200879086fc8e55d4a", "ja": "なるほど。\n自分では手応えが感じられない……ってことか？", "zh": "原来如此。\n也就是说，你自己感觉不到什么成效……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "b14d52374d0779cf1e48f6e31f498f15913bd66ff00ef2d153b77da500652e3d", "ja": "うん……。\nがんばってみた、けど……自信は……。", "zh": "嗯……\n杏奈有努力去尝试了，可是……没什么自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1f89fdd103dcb4791bc85627059ffc521874c1a71d35805f04d4b7fcdaec4cb5", "ja": "そうか……。でも大丈夫だと思うぞ！\n杏奈の姿は、恋する女の子にちゃんと見えてたよ。", "zh": "这样啊……不过我觉得没问题！\n杏奈的样子，确实就是恋爱中的女孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "1a96571f6841604e1199b6f5cc5b634309f8200bf8de0504b4bd3c6a60e26d2c", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、そう言うなら……\nだいじょうぶ、なのかな……？", "zh": "既然{$P$}先生都这么说……  \n应该没问题吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1010_p", "source_sha256": "409df3a789d5e48505efd8463e39b8b6d5e084a19e522ba21b2cc451d66701ea", "ja": "ああ。……もしかすると、PVの撮影だったから、\nうまく表現できてたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "啊……也许正因为是在拍摄PV，才发挥得比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "ddec31b1b5eaa59df810580d07a7a36aa4a3f6721fd0dfbcaab4d1fafd8aeee1", "ja": "PVだから？　えと、どういうこと……？", "zh": "因为是PV？那个……是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1012_p", "source_sha256": "61977f015d1de0b2bed312c26e1340cca5cd4f1294d6c4a8f32bd03468b6b4ae", "ja": "杏奈は、この曲をたくさん歌ってきただろ？\nその度に、ファンが喜ぶことを考えたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "杏奈，你唱过很多次这首歌吧？\n每次你都会想，怎样才能让粉丝开心，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8fc17501da111d8492945dab416b33ed7aff56dfa11cfbf6cf107e62c76ff022", "ja": "撮影の時も、曲を流してたし。杏奈のそういう気持ちが\n恋する女の子に重なったのかもしれない。", "zh": "拍摄的时候也一直放着这首歌。也许正是杏奈的这份心情，和恋爱中的女孩子重叠在了一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "6dc04068a6d0f31fbd74713c84d97b1faaed6ed9bf0e8d13b82e5cb8c71412f2", "ja": "そっか……。曲を聞いてたら……ファンのみんなのこと\n考えてた……。いつも、いっぱい応援してくれて……。", "zh": "这样啊……听着歌的时候……我就在想粉丝们的事……。一直以来，大家都给了我那么多支持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "bc63f88537abb4508d5de9bfd0ed369a818319e6db69c09662c9dbc4308ed13c", "ja": "杏奈、すごくうれしくて……。どうしたら……\nみんなに……お返しができる、かなって……。", "zh": "杏奈特别开心……就在想……要怎么做，才能……回报大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1016_p", "source_sha256": "feaba52f08d586010043b90e85b6f5310b02999cbb230e13e732d6d2818f46ef", "ja": "うん。そういう杏奈の優しい気持ちが、\n役柄とピッタリ合ったんだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。我想正是杏奈这种温柔的心情，\n才和角色完全契合上了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "5a4cb8f3a6919283e6baef5f006f99e7903018c29c49948ac79af444cf284620", "ja": "そっか……。杏奈……ずっとしてたんだ、ね……。\n恋する女の子と、同じ気持ち……。", "zh": "原来是这样……杏奈……一直以来，都怀着这种心情……呢……\n和恋爱中的女孩子，一样的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d50392d5e83c012f82f0e109f84cf1381f556f1989bc8b7d4213e373031e6ab0", "ja": "ああ。アイドルに恋をして、ファンに恋をして……\nとても素敵な関係だな。", "zh": "是啊。爱上偶像，也爱上粉丝……\n真是一段美好的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "bf1c281f8e1ebb8b9f681383de8e169e1d5aa5ac8cddd38e65f0e14922d3a369", "ja": "うん……。杏奈も……そう思い、ます……。ちゃんと、\n撮影できたのは……みんなのおかげ、だね……。", "zh": "嗯……。杏奈也……这么觉得……。能好好\n完成拍摄……多亏了大家、呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0314_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "59c70a7e66af2b61f7057f13c3fa737dddf9c2cbb9e176cf705f5ac703426282", "ja": "杏奈……これからも、いっぱい……がんばります……。\n{$P$}さんも、応援して、ね……？", "zh": "杏奈……今后也会继续……努力的……。\n也请为{$P$}先生加油，好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
